# Visual Assets Directory

This directory contains visual assets for the Qui Browser VR project.

## Structure

```
assets/
├── images/         - Social-share images (this directory)
└── icons/          - PWA / favicon icons (sibling directory)
```

## Current Assets

The following files are shipped and wired into `index.html`:

- `og-image.png` - Open Graph image (1200x630), referenced by `og:image`
- `twitter-card.png` - Twitter card image (1200x630), referenced by `twitter:image`

Icons are shipped in the sibling `assets/icons/` directory:

- `favicon-16x16.png`, `favicon-32x32.png` - Browser favicons (`index.html`)
- `apple-touch-icon.png` - iOS home-screen icon (`index.html`)
- `icon-72.png`, `icon-96.png`, `icon-128.png`, `icon-144.png`,
  `icon-192.png`, `icon-384.png`, `icon-512.png`, `icon.svg` - PWA
  icons (`manifest.json`)

